{"id":"08bea511-788b-454b-9ab8-077cd2c9bdf2","createdAt":"2026-10-26T15:46:19.496Z","batchId":"onboarding_gpt-6-luna_high","approach":"html","modelId":"gpt-6-luna","settings":{"effort":"high"},"presetId":"onboarding","prompt":"A three-step onboarding wizard: account, preferences, done. Show the current step and next/back buttons.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<main class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n  <header class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n    <p class=\"small muted\">SETUP · 3 STEPS</p>\n    <h1 class=\"h1\">Let’s get you set up</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead\">Create your account, choose what you’d like to hear about, and you’re done.</p>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"card stack gap-lg\" aria-label=\"Onboarding wizard\">\n    <div class=\"between\">\n      <h2 class=\"h2\">Your setup</h2>\n      <span id=\"step-count\" class=\"badge\">Step 1 of 3</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <ol class=\"grid cols-3 gap-sm\" aria-label=\"Onboarding steps\">\n      <li id=\"step-indicator-1\" class=\"card stack gap-sm\" aria-current=\"step\">\n        <span id=\"step-chip-1\" class=\"badge\">1</span>\n        <strong>Account</strong>\n      </li>\n      <li id=\"step-indicator-2\" class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n        <span id=\"step-chip-2\" class=\"badge badge-outline\">2</span>\n        <strong>Preferences</strong>\n      </li>\n      <li id=\"step-indicator-3\" class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n        <span id=\"step-chip-3\" class=\"badge badge-outline\">3</span>\n        <strong>Done</strong>\n      </li>\n    </ol>\n\n    <div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Setup progress\" aria-valuemin=\"1\" aria-valuemax=\"3\" aria-valuenow=\"1\">\n      <div id=\"progress-fill\" style=\"width:33%\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <form id=\"onboarding-form\" class=\"stack gap-lg\" novalidate>\n      <section id=\"panel-1\" class=\"stack gap-lg\" aria-labelledby=\"account-heading\">\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <h3 id=\"account-heading\" class=\"h3\">Create your account</h3>\n          <p class=\"muted\">Use these details to sign in to your account.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"grid cols-2 gap-sm\">\n          <label class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n            <span>Full name</span>\n            <input name=\"fullName\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"name\" placeholder=\"Your name\" required>\n          </label>\n          <label class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n            <span>Email address</span>\n            <input name=\"email\" type=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\" required>\n          </label>\n        </div>\n\n        <label class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <span>Password</span>\n          <input name=\"password\" type=\"password\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" minlength=\"8\" placeholder=\"At least 8 characters\" required>\n          <span class=\"small muted\">Choose a password with at least 8 characters.</span>\n        </label>\n      </section>\n\n      <section id=\"panel-2\" class=\"stack gap-lg\" aria-labelledby=\"preferences-heading\" hidden>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <h3 id=\"preferences-heading\" class=\"h3\">Choose your preferences</h3>\n          <p class=\"muted\">Pick the updates you’d like. You can change these anytime.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Topics\">\n          <strong>What are you interested in?</strong>\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"topics\" value=\"Product updates\"> Product updates</label>\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"topics\" value=\"Practical tutorials\"> Practical tutorials</label>\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"topics\" value=\"Community events\"> Community events</label>\n          <p id=\"topics-error\" class=\"alert alert-destructive\" role=\"alert\" hidden>Select at least one topic to continue.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Email frequency\">\n          <strong>How often should we email you?</strong>\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"frequency\" value=\"As updates happen\"> As updates happen</label>\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"frequency\" value=\"Weekly summary\" checked> Weekly summary</label>\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"frequency\" value=\"Monthly summary\"> Monthly summary</label>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section id=\"panel-3\" class=\"stack gap-lg\" aria-labelledby=\"done-heading\" hidden>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <span class=\"badge\">Complete</span>\n          <h3 id=\"done-heading\" class=\"h3\">You’re all set</h3>\n          <p class=\"muted\">Your account and preferences are ready. Here’s a quick review of your setup.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n          <h4 class=\"h4\">Account</h4>\n          <p id=\"summary-name\">Name</p>\n          <p id=\"summary-email\" class=\"muted\">Email</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n          <h4 class=\"h4\">Preferences</h4>\n          <p><strong>Topics:</strong> <span id=\"summary-topics\">—</span></p>\n          <p><strong>Email frequency:</strong> <span id=\"summary-frequency\">—</span></p>\n        </div>\n\n        <p id=\"finish-message\" class=\"alert\" aria-live=\"polite\" hidden></p>\n      </section>\n\n      <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"between gap-sm\">\n        <button id=\"back-button\" class=\"btn btn-outline\" type=\"button\" disabled>Back</button>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n          <button id=\"next-button\" class=\"btn\" type=\"button\">Next</button>\n          <button id=\"finish-button\" class=\"btn\" type=\"button\" hidden>Finish</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </form>\n  </section>\n</main>\n\n<script>\n  (() => {\n    const form = document.getElementById(\"onboarding-form\");\n    const panels = [1, 2, 3].map((step) => document.getElementById(`panel-${step}`));\n    const backButton = document.getElementById(\"back-button\");\n    const nextButton = document.getElementById(\"next-button\");\n    const finishButton = document.getElementById(\"finish-button\");\n    const stepCount = document.getElementById(\"step-count\");\n    const progress = document.querySelector('[role=\"progressbar\"]');\n    const progressFill = document.getElementById(\"progress-fill\");\n    let currentStep = 1;\n\n    function updateSummary() {\n      const values = new FormData(form);\n      const topics = values.getAll(\"topics\");\n      document.getElementById(\"summary-name\").textContent = values.get(\"fullName\") || \"Name not provided\";\n      document.getElementById(\"summary-email\").textContent = values.get(\"email\") || \"Email not provided\";\n      document.getElementById(\"summary-topics\").textContent = topics.length ? topics.join(\", \") : \"No topics selected\";\n      document.getElementById(\"summary-frequency\").textContent = values.get(\"frequency\") || \"No email frequency selected\";\n    }\n\n    function showStep(step) {\n      currentStep = step;\n      panels.forEach((panel, index) => {\n        panel.hidden = index + 1 !== step;\n      });\n\n      stepCount.textContent = `Step ${step} of 3`;\n      progress.setAttribute(\"aria-valuenow\", String(step));\n      progressFill.style.width = `${Math.round((step / 3) * 100)}%`;\n      backButton.disabled = step === 1;\n      nextButton.hidden = step === 3;\n      finishButton.hidden = step !== 3;\n\n      [1, 2, 3].forEach((number) => {\n        const indicator = document.getElementById(`step-indicator-${number}`);\n        const chip = document.getElementById(`step-chip-${number}`);\n        if (number === step) {\n          indicator.setAttribute(\"aria-current\", \"step\");\n          chip.className = \"badge\";\n        } else {\n          indicator.removeAttribute(\"aria-current\");\n          chip.className = number < step ? \"badge badge-secondary\" : \"badge badge-outline\";\n        }\n      });\n\n      if (step === 3) updateSummary();\n    }\n\n    nextButton.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n      if (currentStep === 1) {\n        const accountFields = panels[0].querySelectorAll(\"input[required]\");\n        for (const field of accountFields) {\n          if (!field.checkValidity()) {\n            field.reportValidity();\n            return;\n          }\n        }\n      }\n\n      if (currentStep === 2) {\n        const selectedTopics = form.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"topics\"]:checked');\n        const error = document.getElementById(\"topics-error\");\n        if (!selectedTopics.length) {\n          error.hidden = false;\n          return;\n        }\n        error.hidden = true;\n      }\n\n      showStep(Math.min(currentStep + 1, 3));\n    });\n\n    backButton.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n      if (currentStep > 1) {\n        document.getElementById(\"topics-error\").hidden = true;\n        showStep(currentStep - 1);\n      }\n    });\n\n    form.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"topics\"]').forEach((input) => {\n      input.addEventListener(\"change\", () => {\n        if (form.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"topics\"]:checked').length) {\n          document.getElementById(\"topics-error\").hidden = true;\n        }\n      });\n    });\n\n    finishButton.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n      const message = document.getElementById(\"finish-message\");\n      message.textContent = \"Setup complete. Your account preferences are ready.\";\n      message.hidden = false;\n      finishButton.textContent = \"Finished\";\n      finishButton.disabled = true;\n    });\n  })();\n</script>","deltas":[[27050,"<"],[27098,"main"],[27100," class"],[27101,"=\""],[27103,"page"],[27139," stack"],[27237," gap"],[27237,"-lg"],[27237,"\">\n"],[27237," "],[27239," <"],[27239,"header"],[27239," class"],[27239,"=\""],[27240,"stack"],[27240," gap"],[27240,"-sm"],[27240,"\">\n"],[27240,"   "],[27240," <"],[27240,"p"],[27240," class"],[27240,"=\""],[27240,"small"],[27241," muted"],[27241,"\">"],[27241,"SET"],[27241,"UP"],[27241," ·"],[27241," "],[27241,"3"],[27241," STE"],[27241,"PS"],[27241,"</"],[27244,"p"],[27244,">\n"],[27244,"   "],[27244," <"],[27244,"h"],[27244,"1"],[27244," class"],[27244,"=\""],[27244,"h"],[27245,"1"],[27250,"\">"],[27250,"Let"],[27250,"’s"],[27250," get"],[27250," you"],[27250," set"],[27250," up"],[27250,"</"],[27250,"h"],[27257,"1"],[27257,">\n"],[27257,"   "],[27257," <"],[27257,"p"],[27257," class"],[27257,"=\""],[27271,"lead"],[27283,"\">"],[27297,"Create"],[27308," your"],[27312," account"],[27315,","],[27323," choose"],[27351," what"],[27479," you"],[27479,"’d"],[27479," like"],[27479," to"],[27479," hear"],[27479," about"],[27479,","],[27480," and"],[27492," you"],[27498,"’re"],[27509," done"],[27515,".</"],[27516,"p"],[27516,">\n"],[27516," "],[27520," </"],[27520,"header"],[27520,">\n\n"],[27520," "],[27537," <"],[27564,"section"],[27564," class"],[27573,"=\""],[27573,"card"],[27604," stack"],[27613," gap"],[27619,"-lg"],[27620,"\""],[27621," aria"],[27629,"-label"],[27633,"=\""],[27645,"On"],[27646,"boarding"],[27656," wizard"],[27666,"\">\n"],[27676,"   "],[27676," <"],[27680,"div"],[27686," class"],[27686,"=\""],[27691,"between"],[27707,"\">\n"],[27708,"     "],[27711," <"],[27730,"h"],[27741,"2"],[27744," class"],[27746,"=\""],[27755,"h"],[27767,"2"],[27771,"\">"],[27771,"Your"],[27782," setup"],[27795,"</"],[27795,"h"],[